*AND*
D) The NOCAR shall:
    d.1) be complete and consistent;
    d.2) (AND) conclude that the Target of Evaluation is complying with the national obligations.
*AND*
E) The Applicant shall have:
    a.1) committed to apply the measures documented in the NOCAR report over time; 
    a.2) (AND) where applicable, established a detailed action plan to comply with the NOCAR recommended measures;
    a.3) (AND) where applicable, applied and documented the actions contained in the action plan that are required to comply with the national obligations.

A) The Applicant shall have rules, a procedure or a mechanism in place to:
